Subject: [PATCH] fix(generator): target the Stalwart v1.0.3 schema

v1 renamed fields that requiredOverrides names (DNS provider keys,
MtaMilter.host, MtaRouteRelay.host, TracerOtelHttp.url), turned AiModel
into a variant union and added objects. Required sets for the new types
were probed against a live v1.0.3 server.

Application bundles and lookup stores have independent server caches; use
UpdateApps and ReloadLookupStores rather than ReloadSettings.

OAuthGrant and IndexQueueStatus are read-only runtime objects whose
creation the server forbids, so expose them as data sources only.
